                                Premium flagship Specialization
                            </span>
                            <h3 style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #ffffff;">SAP ERP Enterprise Solutions</h3>
                            <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; max-width: 700px;">
