                            </p>

                            <p style="color: #a78bfa; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                                <i class='bx bx-mouse-pointer' style="font-size: 1.2rem;"></i> Click on any module below to view detailed syllabus and schedule:
